WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
Commas in dates and places.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.020
A date:

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:04.750
June 12, 1941.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.230
The comma sits between the day and the year.

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:09.060
A place:

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:10.660
Dover, Kent.

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:15.680
The comma sits between the town and the bigger place it belongs to.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:20.270
If the sentence keeps going, add one more comma after.
